Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An organism controlled by the Dublinn forces, they are stronger in combat than the average Hound. They were originally purchased from a mercenary group, and have undergone training for a longer period. Equipped with a refractive mask crafted by Shadowcasters, they are rather resistant to regular Originium Arts.","abilities":["Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.7,"stats":{"hp":4000,"atk":380,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.4}},"dublinn_shadowcaster_leader":{"slug":"dublinn_shadowcaster_leader","name":"Dublinn Shadowcaster Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dublinn Shadowcaster Leader.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A caster leader in the Dublinn forces. Their Originium Arts do not stand out, but the innovative breakthrough of the casters under their command in mass-producing Arts-resistant masks has granted them considerable recognition from their leader.","abilities":["Refraction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.1,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":460,"def":150,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"enraged_tombkeeper_grotesque":{"slug":"enraged_tombkeeper_grotesque","name":"Enraged Tombkeeper Grotesque","icon":"/enemies-icons/Enraged Tombkeeper Grotesque.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Arts Creation","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical","Arts"],"flavourText":"A special Arts creation from the Dublinn forces, created by their leader Mandragora. According to Mandragora, back when she was studying Originium Arts in an outskirts cemetery, the Tombkeeper Grotesque was her first companion. Its outer appearance has gone through many redesigns, with the latest being based off a Sarkaz from an ancient bloodline. This s